---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'October 9, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="Disclaimer for CodesCompiler educational tutorials, code examples, tools, links, and advertising."
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-white shadow-sm my-8 rounded-lg">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4">Disclaimer</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8"><strong>Last Updated:</strong> {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="prose prose-brand prose-lg max-w-none">
      <h2>1. Educational Information</h2>
      <p>
        CodesCompiler provides programming tutorials, examples, definitions, articles,
        references, and tools for educational and informational purposes. We make reasonable
        efforts to keep our material useful and accurate, but technology changes frequently
        and we cannot guarantee that every example or statement will always be current,
        complete, or error-free.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Code Examples</h2>
      <p>
        Code examples are provided for learning and experimentation. You are responsible for
        testing code and determining whether it is appropriate for your own project,
        environment, security requirements, and production use.
      </p>

      <h2>3. External Links</h2>
      <p>
        Our website may contain links to third-party websites, documentation, products,
        services, and social media platforms. We do not control those websites and are not
        responsible for their content, availability, security, or privacy practices.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Advertising</h2>
      <p>
        CodesCompiler may display advertisements from Google AdSense and other advertising
        partners. The appearance of an advertisement does not constitute an endorsement,
        recommendation, or guarantee of the advertised product or service.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Availability</h2>
      <p>
        We try to keep CodesCompiler available and functional, but we do not guarantee
        uninterrupted access. Features, tutorials, tools, links, and other website content
        may be changed, removed, or temporarily unavailable.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        If you find an error or have a correction suggestion, please contact
        <a href="mailto:contact@codescompiler.com">contact@codescompiler.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
